{"id":"902106c2351e64fe","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-cohen-forcing-CH.md","title":"Cohen Forcing Makes ¬CH","display":"thm-cohen-forcing-CH — Cohen Forcing Makes ¬CH","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-cohen-forcing-CH","aliases":["58-thm-cohen-forcing-CH","Cohen Forcing ¬CH","Adding Many Reals"],"display":"thm-cohen-forcing-CH — Cohen Forcing Makes ¬CH","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-cohen.md]]","[[../batch03/58-thm-generic-extension-model.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]]","[[58-df-generic-extension]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ch.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-cohen-forcing-CH"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-cohen-forcing-CH</span><span>Cohen Forcing ¬CH</span><span>Adding Many Reals</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cohen-forcing-CH — Cohen Forcing Makes ¬CH"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa69e82627a80f1e\" href=\"?note=aa69e82627a80f1e\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-cohen.md\">../batch14/58-df-cohen.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8eb8466c3c417107\" href=\"?note=8eb8466c3c417107\" title=\"../batch03/58-thm-generic-extension-model.md\">../batch03/58-thm-generic-extension-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md\">../batch17/58-df-aleph.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"58-df-generic-extension\">58-df-generic-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a8e91517c28976b8\" href=\"?note=a8e91517c28976b8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ch.md\">../batch14/58-df-ch.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\)</span> (countable transitive model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{GCH}}=\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{\\chi_{\\mathrm{GCH}}\\}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{GCH}}=\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{\\chi_{\\mathrm{GCH}}\\}\\)</span> (the ground theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\neg\\mathrm{CH},\\aleph_2}=\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{\\neg\\chi_{\\mathrm{CH}},\\chi_{2^{\\aleph_0}=\\aleph_2}\\}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\neg\\mathrm{CH},\\aleph_2}=\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{\\neg\\chi_{\\mathrm{CH}},\\chi_{2^{\\aleph_0}=\\aleph_2}\\}\\)</span> (the target theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\omega_2^M\">\\(\\kappa=\\omega_2^M\\)</span> (the second uncountable cardinal of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\operatorname{Add}(\\omega,\\kappa)^M\">\\(P=\\operatorname{Add}(\\omega,\\kappa)^M\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"aa69e82627a80f1e\" href=\"?note=aa69e82627a80f1e\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-cohen.md\">../batch14/58-df-cohen.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-generic filter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{GCH}},P,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{GCH}},P,G)\\)</span> (generic extension, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"58-df-generic-extension\">58-df-generic-extension</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}CH}\\vdash\n\\forall M,P,\\leq_P,G,\\kappa,N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{GCH}}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma_{\\neg\\mathrm{CH},\\aleph_2}\\land\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{GCH}})\\land\n\\kappa=\\omega_2^M\\land\n\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\land\n\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{GCH}},P,G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(N,\\Gamma_{\\neg\\mathrm{CH},\\aleph_2})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}CH}\\vdash\n\\forall M,P,\\leq_P,G,\\kappa,N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{GCH}}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma_{\\neg\\mathrm{CH},\\aleph_2}\\land\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{GCH}})\\land\n\\kappa=\\omega_2^M\\land\n\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\land\n\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{GCH}},P,G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(N,\\Gamma_{\\neg\\mathrm{CH},\\aleph_2})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Specifying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\operatorname{Add}(\\omega,\\omega_2)^M\">\\(P=\\operatorname{Add}(\\omega,\\omega_2)^M\\)</span> is essential; the conclusion is false for an arbitrary forcing poset.</li>\n<li>The c.c.c. preserves cardinals, while GCH in the ground supplies the upper bound\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\omega_2^{\\aleph_0})^M=\\omega_2^M\">\\((\\omega_2^{\\aleph_0})^M=\\omega_2^M\\)</span> needed for equality.</li>\n<li>More generally, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Add}(\\omega,\\kappa)\">\\(\\operatorname{Add}(\\omega,\\kappa)\\)</span> forces <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\leq2^{\\aleph_0}\">\\(\\kappa\\leq2^{\\aleph_0}\\)</span>; equality needs an appropriate ground-model cardinal-arithmetic bound.</li>\n<li>Ground and extension truth are expressed by the theory-parameterized CTM predicate; the forcing order required by both Cohen forcing and genericity is explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-cohen.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa69e82627a80f1e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-cohen.md]]","embed":false},{"target